{"title":"Career roadmap · Event Coordinator","role":"Event Coordinator","summary":"An Event Coordinator plans and executes events by coordinating venues, vendors, schedules, guests, logistics, budgets, production teams, hospitality and on-site operations.","facts":{"Current degree":"BHM / B.Sc Hospitality & Hotel Administration / BTTM","Course":"Event Management"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For Event Management, this is a strong direct alignment and is commonly an entry-level role after graduation."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BHM/B.Sc Hospitality","Event Management Internship","Event Coordinator / Event Executive","Senior Event Coordinator","Event Manager","Senior Event Manager","Event Director / Head of Events"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build event planning, hospitality, vendor coordination, budgeting, communication and event-production skills. Complete 2–3 internships and participate in live events."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Manage events independently and specialise in corporate, wedding, MICE, sports, entertainment, exhibitions or luxury events."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Event Manager, Senior Event Manager, Production Manager or Event Operations Manager."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead large events, event portfolios, agencies or corporate event functions and potentially build an event-management business."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Hospitality + event fundamentals"},{"text":"Event planning, communication"},{"text":"Small-event plan"},{"text":"Foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Event ope